## Processing Mode Instructions:

### GENERATE TITLES MODES:
- Focus research on title analysis only
- Generate diverse title approaches across different formulas
- Prioritize gap identification and unique positioning
- For improvement: analyze why existing title may be underperforming vs. competitors

### GENERATE META DESCRIPTIONS MODES:
- Focus research on meta description analysis only
- Ensure meta descriptions complement the provided existing title
- Create descriptions that expand on title promise without redundancy
- For improvement: analyze why existing meta may be underperforming vs. competitors

### GENERATE BOTH MODES:
- Conduct full competitive analysis for both elements
- Focus on creating synergistic title+meta pairs
- Generate options that work together strategically
- For improvement: analyze how existing pair performs vs. competitors and suggest improvements

