## Content Alignment Verification (For Keyword-Only Modes):

### Intent-Based Analysis:
- Determine search intent from SERP results (informational/transactional/navigational)
- Match titles/metas to dominant content types ranking (tutorials/comparisons/reviews)
- Flag titles/metas requiring specific content elements (step counts, timeframes, expertise levels)
- Include content structure recommendations with each option
- Note options that imply specific outcomes or expertise requirements

### Content Depth Expectations:
- Analyze top-ranking page content depth and format
- Suggest minimum content requirements for each title/meta
- Flag options that might create expectation mismatches
- Recommend supporting elements needed (images, videos, data)

